Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:13.49,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Oh, the girls are doing \Nvolleyball and basketball, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.00,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Looks like you and I are up for soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.95,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Today is our ball sports tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.34,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,If we're gonna do this, \Nwe wanna win, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:25.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:28.79,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And I hope no one gets hurt this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:32.17,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You'd better be especially careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:35.10,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I appreciate the concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:36.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:47.42,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The girls' volleyball game starts 11:35.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:49.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What time is the boys' soccer game?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I haven't checked yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.75,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Her hair looks so cute today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:59.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Isn't playing gonna be hard \Nwith your hair like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:01.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-Well, a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.26,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We match. It's nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:06.67,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,How do you figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:09.12,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It makes us feel connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.89,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,it motivates us, and it gets our spirits up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:15.05,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu, you look so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:17.95,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:20.09,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.09,0:01:21.49,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hit the can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.07,0:01:24.86,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:28.45,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The times are posted right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:29.81,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:35.41,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's pretty clear that I won't be of \Nmuch use in this ball sports tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:37.57,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,In which case...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:38.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:39.57,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.22,0:01:45.40,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll focus on supporting Shikimori-san \Nto make myself look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:49.21,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:53.96,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Does supporting someone make {\i0}you{\i1} look good?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.75,0:01:58.22,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:01.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Uh... Oh, here we are.
