Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:05.35,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\an8\b1\shad0\bord0\c&HFA764F&\move(72.667,244,72.667,218,1,1270)}Boys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:07.53,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:12.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Looks like we won't be able \Nto cheer each other on today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.58,0:02:16.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Our opponent in the first match \Nis the favorite to win, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:22.87,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord3\an8\3c&H4178C6&\c&HD4F6FE&\pos(97.333,69.333)}Volleyball
