Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:22.87,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs16\3c&H36816D&\c&HB3F9FC&\pos(270.666,233.333)}Basketball
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:20.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Neko is in the volleyball club,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,and she says they've got\Nthe ace on their team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:27.30,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It won't be easy for our class to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:29.33,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:33.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Even if we're apart, I'll be \Ncheering you on the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll send you my good vibes now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:43.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You can do it! Don't get hurt! Hnngh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:46.22,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:49.34,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
