Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.74,Main,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\an1\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\b1\fs28\shad0\3c&H1B191E&\pos(54,310)}#02  {\fs24\fscy110}Wind and Clouds, Ball Sports Tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.47,Main,Students,0,0,0,,{\an8}You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:23.20,Main,Students,0,0,0,,{\an8}Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.08,Main,Students,0,0,0,,{\an8}You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:25.32,Main,Girl Classmate 1 (Other Team),0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:26.56,Main,Students,0,0,0,,Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:27.32,Main,Students,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:29.33,Main,Students,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:49.29,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:51.64,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Man, is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:54.14,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,His bad luck's rearing\N its head from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:05:00.65,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san sent me good vibes \Nso I wouldn't get hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:09.04,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You can do it! Don't get hurt! Hnngh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:10.87,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:33.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ack! Yeowch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.54,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe it worked. Coulda been way worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.84,Main,BoyA,0,0,0,,Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:49.24,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:50.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:55.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.65,0:05:57.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The ball's coming at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:59.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.00,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Was that a "good luck"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:10.14,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.89,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That had to hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:13.98,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.77,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,The volleyball game's gonna start!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:18.80,Main,Boys,0,0,0,,{\an8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sorry! You go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:19.69,Main,Boys,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.71,Main,Boys,0,0,0,,{\an8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:25.11,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Jeez, she's so overprotective.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.69,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fay-.23\pos(307.333,132.667)\c&H5A5B66&\3c&HEBEFEF&\4c&HEBEFEF&}Nurse's Office
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:33.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You don't feel ill, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.73,0:06:37.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Do you want some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:43.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What about you? Will you make \Nit to your volleyball game?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I still have some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:50.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Still, I can't believe the ball hit you \Nright smack in the face like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:54.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Don't remind me. I looked so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:58.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It wasn't bad luck this time. \NIt was just clumsiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.60,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Do you have to be so frank?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:05.36,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I made her worry again. I'm pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:15.14,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You have such pretty hair, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,R-Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:22.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This scar... I didn't know \Nyou had such a big scar here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:24.50,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,That tickles...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I suffered some pretty \Nbad injuries in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:33.39,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I have scars all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:37.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I think this was from the time \Na truck ran into our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:42.02,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnArial\c&H5D53E5&\\shad0\bord0\pos(270,46.667)}C {\fs20}R A {\fs20}S {\fs24}H
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:42.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I swear, nothing you say\N will ever surprise me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:45.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:48.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,do worry about you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.81,0:07:54.95,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So please stay by my side \Nas much as possible, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:59.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,R-Really, I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:06.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, I should head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:12.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:19.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can protect you, too, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:26.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll head back after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:26.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.03,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But the game will start without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:30.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:35.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll hide in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:38.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wha— Buh— Wai—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I was just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Don't tease me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:56.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.89,0:09:12.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I came on too strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:16.96,Main,Students,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:17.99,Main,Students,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:19.28,Main,Students,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.70,Main,Students,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.42,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Good game!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.42,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Goin' all out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.43,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I am... not...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.94,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, you're wheezing pretty hard, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:43.91,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Well, we'll win the volleyball \Ngame! Cheer for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:45.64,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:48.05,Main,Younger Girl 1,0,0,0,,Oh, she's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:54.63,Main,Younger Girl 1,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you, Kamiya-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:55.69,Main,Younger Girl 2,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:57.40,Main,Younger Girl 1,0,0,0,,Please, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.28,Main,Younger Girl 2,0,0,0,,And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:09:59.88,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:02.19,Main,Younger Girl 2,0,0,0,,Well, bye now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.42,Main,Younger Girl 3,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:10.33,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,As popular as ever, huh, Kamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:13.84,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess they're expecting a lot of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:17.47,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We're not gonna lose this match!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:19.52,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.55,0:10:22.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:25.04,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon, you're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sorry! Did it start yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.97,0:10:28.48,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Just about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.07,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:39.08,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the volleyball ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:40.29,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.37,Main,Younger Girl 2,0,0,0,,Kamiya-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:50.12,Main,Younger Girl 1,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:57.18,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I knew she was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:57.39,Main,Younger Girl 1,0,0,0,,{\an8}That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.65,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,She's quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:04.14,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord0\shad0\c&HFFFDF6&\an1\fay.11\move(100.667,106,100.667,36.667)}Team
