Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:02.33,Main,Boy1,0,0,0,,Good game!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:04.14,Main,Boy2,0,0,0,,Wanna catch the girls' volleyball game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:10.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,It's over... Our summer is over...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:13.17,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\3c&H6E646F&\pos(158.666,290)}Rejoined During Stoppage Time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:13.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It hasn't even started yet. It's still spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.65,Main,Mob,0,0,0,,What the heck happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.90,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Anyway, you ended up getting \Nhurt after all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:22.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, but thankfully it wasn't serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:23.28,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wonder if the girls are still playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.45,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:28.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:29.76,Main,Students,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:30.83,Main,Students,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:32.54,Main,Students,0,0,0,,That's the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:35.32,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Let's see your spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:38.89,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Shikimori! Nekozaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:41.01,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Let's see your spirit! Your spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:43.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's watch from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Don't trip on the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:45.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:46.51,Main,Students,0,0,0,,You got it! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:47.93,Main,Students,0,0,0,,Get the next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:49.62,Main,Students,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Neko! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:55.90,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Damn, she's taking this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:58.15,Main,StudentA,0,0,0,,Man, they're on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:00.24,Main,StudentB,0,0,0,,And they're still on the first round!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:02.65,Main,StudentC,0,0,0,,Go for it! Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:04.02,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:06.48,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You came at the perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:09.44,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey, you're still wearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:10.74,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Looks like an exciting game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.42,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,It's still going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:15.48,Main,Student,0,0,0,,There she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:21.88,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Damn, she's good! How many \Nspikes has she received now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:23.24,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.82,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Shikimori's kind of awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:26.81,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:31.02,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Wait... our class is still losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:36.86,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:41.04,Main,Students,0,0,0,,One more point!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:41.99,Main,Students,0,0,0,,You can get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:44.74,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Looks like your bae came to cheer for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:50.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, I can't lose now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:05.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Who is that hot guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:08.01,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Dude, chill. That's your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is that Kamiya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:20.61,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:22.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:29.54,Main,Students,0,0,0,,{\an8}That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:29.54,Main,BoyA,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.87,Main,GirlB,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:43.27,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,All right! They tied it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.63,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:05.20,Main,Girl Classmate C,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.15,Main,Boy Classmate A,0,0,0,,Go, Shikimori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:09.91,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:19.89,Main,Students,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:22.50,Main,Students,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.51,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They won...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:27.13,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.13,0:14:28.26,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:31.20,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Neko... We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.39,0:14:42.27,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.85,0:14:48.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:51.32,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:52.62,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:15:00.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You were amazing, Shikimori-san! \NI knew you could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:01.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:06.34,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:07.86,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Good game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:09.84,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I bet you can win the next one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:12.60,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Heck yeah! We gotta do this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:14.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll be cheering you on with all I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:17.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:30.14,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Great tournament, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:33.94,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Nekozaki, you were awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:35.24,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I was impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.83,Main,Girl Classmate G,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san was amazing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:41.21,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\fs16\b1\3c&H3B4C37&\4c&H3B4C37&\c&HC4D2C4&}Celebrate {\c&H9250BB&}♥ {\c&HC4D2C4&}2-4 \N{\fs28\c&H7BEADA&}Volleyball Victory{\c&H9250BB&}!! \N{\fs20\c&HC8B566&}Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.47,Main,Girl Classmate B,0,0,0,,I think I cried a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:41.21,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:45.46,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we do karaoke? I love singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:48.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You really were amazing, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:54.72,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, no... I only did so well \Nbecause you were cheering for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.15,0:15:58.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, I envy how athletic you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.35,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:03.85,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\an1\c&HFFF9FC&\bord1\3c&H5C6465&\pos(51.999,40.666)}Blocked a newspaper\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hwithout looking
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:03.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You constantly radiate athleticism.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:06.04,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't really...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:07.61,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.87,0:16:11.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I got knocked out\N of the game first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:13.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I know you did your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:17.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think you look so cool when \Nyou're trying your hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:21.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.94,Main,Younger Student D,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Can I get a picture with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:30.85,Main,Younger Student C,0,0,0,,Please tell me your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:32.38,Main,Younger Student E,0,0,0,,Can I shake your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.81,Main,Younger Student C,0,0,0,,Who's he? Your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:39.75,Main,Younger Student D,0,0,0,,He's kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:41.02,Main,Younger Student E,0,0,0,,He is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:42.08,Main,Girls,0,0,0,,So cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:43.26,Main,Girls,0,0,0,,So cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.89,Main,Girls,0,0,0,,So cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:50.32,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,My girlfriend has become the school hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:53.99,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFBFEFD&\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(316.666,273.333)}A Few Days Later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:56.61,Main,Younger Student E,0,0,0,,You look so cool again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:17:00.12,Main,Younger Student C,0,0,0,,Shikimori-senpai! Would you \Nplease eat lunch with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:03.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:06.09,Main,Younger Student B,0,0,0,,Do you make your own lunches?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:07.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:09.50,Main,Younger Student D,0,0,0,,Is there anyone you eat with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:12.51,Main,Younger Student A,0,0,0,,C-Can I shake your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:13.55,Main,Younger Student C,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:16.51,Main,Younger Student B,0,0,0,,No fair! I want to shake your hand, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:22.37,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Shikimori's become a real celebrity \Nsince the ball sports tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:25.52,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,And look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:29.15,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Okay, get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:34.15,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Each one of you will have \Nten seconds to shake her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.65,0:17:37.66,Main,Younger Girl 4,0,0,0,,I want an instant photo, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:41.66,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,An instant photo...? Y-You really need that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:43.71,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Nekozaki's in on it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:46.07,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,It's been crazy since they won, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:50.13,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I bet this is nothing but a \Npain in the ass for you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:55.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't even get near Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:56.24,Main,Younger Student E,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:18:02.76,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yeah, when she has to be so nice and \Npolite to each one of those fangirls...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's everyone's Shikimori-san now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:07.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I guess that's just how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:09.98,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We live in different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:13.32,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Stop talking like an obsessive fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:16.36,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:17.24,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:25.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Inuzuka-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:29.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That sudden stroke of bad luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:32.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Inuzuka-kun! \NThis was probably my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:36.01,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yeah, probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.30,Main,Younger Student D,0,0,0,,{\an8}That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.27,Main,Younger Student C,0,0,0,,{\an8}What happened? A ball flew in the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:40.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me... I need to get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:40.47,Main,Younger Student E,0,0,0,,{\an8}Should we call the teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please, let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:46.95,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:49.27,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:51.90,Main,Younger Student E,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.31,Main,Younger Student C,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:01.91,Main,Younger Student D,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous when she's angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:04.86,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I can't tell if her eyes are saying "hands off"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:08.04,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,or "you should've protected him."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:09.33,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I'm scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:13.17,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what any of that \Nmeant, but are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Today was kind of exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:27.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I really am hopeless without Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:30.25,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Like when that bucket fell from the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:34.36,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,1)\fnArial\fs18\an8\b1\shad0\c&HECFDFE&\blur2\3c&H404142&\move(380,34,380,63)}Ruthless\NVice Principal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:34.36,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And when I almost walked \Ninto the vice principal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:37.86,Flashback,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You're on your own getting home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:42.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I've caused a lot of trouble \Nfor Inuzuka-kun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:47.79,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But all that aside, \NShikimori-san's gotten so popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:49.37,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She really is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:54.25,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She gets more and more famous every \Ntime there's any kind of event.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:01.01,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:06.62,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wanted to keep her cool side all to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:11.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I close my eyes for one second, \Nand this is what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.99,0:20:14.98,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:22.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:26.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Who said you could go home alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:29.71,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:32.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one who left on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:37.16,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:40.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're basically a celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I figured I shouldn't get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:49.45,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:56.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You know you're the only one \NI want to walk home with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:04.65,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You planned to walk home with \NInuzuka-kun anyway, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:05.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:08.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, you've been with \Nhim all the time lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.38,0:21:09.69,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,More than with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.39,0:21:14.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:16.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry. It's not what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:20.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I was going to wait for you at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:27.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Because I've been missing you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:41.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-If that's what this was about, \Nyou should have said so sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.43,0:21:43.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:46.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.77,0:21:51.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:54.77,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs30\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,297.999)}S{\fs28\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs26\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs26\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs24\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs22\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~
